The de-identified datasets in this directory (emotion_regulation.csv,
spin_severity.csv) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit. Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

These are de-identified self-report research data. They must not be used to
attempt re-identification of participants, nor for individual clinical
diagnosis.
